  <!-- Intro -->
  <p>
    We are moving to Australia this summer with our two kids (6 and 2), more precisely to the Byron Bay / Northern Rivers region. This piece describes how we prepared Joris and Linnea for this big step, and how it then actually went. What worked, what was difficult, what questions a 6-year-old asks and how we deal with it. Our experience. For families planning something similar, or wondering if they'd be mad to do it.
  </p>

